# This folder doubles as an Obsidian vault for daily working notes/context.
# Those notes should stay local and never end up in the public site repo,
# so everything is ignored by default and only the actual site files are
# explicitly allowed back in below. Add new site files/folders here as
# the site grows.

*

!/.gitignore
!/.nojekyll
!/README.md
!/HANDOFF_PROMPT.md
!/index.html
!/llms.txt
!/robots.txt
!/assets/
!/assets/**
!/docs/
!/docs/**
!/experience/
!/experience/**
!/tools/
!/tools/tracker/
!/tools/tracker/index.html
/docs/STOCK_UPDATE_PROMPT.md
